                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a fun game, At least to me. I grew up with CoD mostly.\r\n\r\nYeah sure the story is ass. But i don't play games for the story, I play them to have fun.\r\nIf you turn off your brain and play through the \"owf_staging_prep\" build you will most likely have fun, But not 15 or 10 dollars worth.\r\n\r\nI find the mantle/climbing system interesting but i think it should be more of a garry's mod addon than in this game, But i still like it, Same with the backpack system, would be better as a garry's mod addon, But i still like the idea of it. Forcing you to choose a shotgun or a sniper in the heat of a moment is alot more engaging then just swapping weapons or just scrolling through your gazillon weapons in my honest opinion.\r\n\r\nMost players will not like this game, and i know that, but this game will forever be in my heart for it's interesting weapons, systems and shit design.",
